  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0037552ab6e09a05",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.1 Flash Live：让音频 AI 更自然、更可靠",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40476fa637bd4ae5",
      "translationZh": "我们最新的语音模型提高了精度并降低了延迟，使语音交互更加流畅、自然且精确。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "161e1a3be4edaa89",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 团队软件工程师代表",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "您的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9396d34c840bf012",
      "translationZh": "此内容由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 处于实验阶段",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf6766fc2ee6a0d3",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.1 Flash Live 是 Google 质量最高的音频模型，专为自然且可靠的实时对话而设计。开发者可以通过 Google AI Studio 中的 Gemini Live API 访问它，企业则可将其用于客户体验。每个人都可以通过 Search Live 和 Gemini Live 体验它，目前支持超过 200 个国家。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b43a10482221e5d",
      "translationZh": "摘要由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 处于实验阶段。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "500d632ff20a598e",
      "translationZh": "“Gemini 3.1 Flash Live”来了，让 AI 音频听起来更自然、更可靠。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a925ca3f1b96dd7b",
      "translationZh": "这款新的音频模型速度更快，在理解语气方面表现更好，能够实现自然的对话。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f14ad9618eb5896c",
      "translationZh": "开发者可以使用它来构建语音代理，从而更可靠地处理复杂任务。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "38b57d4ec6d43af7",
      "translationZh": "Gemini Live 和 Search Live 现在在多种语言中提供更有帮助的回复。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5964b77ecfaca1d6",
      "translationZh": "3.1 Flash Live 的所有音频都经过水印处理，以帮助防止错误信息的传播。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f344ef9188695765",
      "translationZh": "探索其他风格：",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "755f612d4eb07e00",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们借助 Gemini 3.1 Flash Live 推进了 Gemini 的实时对话能力，这是我们迄今为止质量最高的音频和语音模型。它提供了下一代以语音为先的 AI 所需的速度和自然节奏，为开发者、企业和普通用户提供了更直观的体验。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "859bf1e3b58d1543",
      "translationZh": "3.1 Flash Live 在 Google 的各类产品中均可使用：",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f18d70ce81d361fa",
      "translationZh": "开发者可通过 Google AI Studio 中的 Gemini Live API 进行预览",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1a54dbc74d62a9e3",
      "translationZh": "面向企业，通过 Gemini Enterprise for Customer Experience 提供",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e89b9242ef6ea9c0",
      "translationZh": "面向所有人，通过 Search Live 和 Gemini Live 提供",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a0b6b0be2d741473",
      "translationZh": "面向开发者：强大的推理与任务执行能力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c77c0dc53eeac729",
      "translationZh": "我们提升了 3.1 Flash Live 的整体质量，让开发者和企业能够更可靠地构建以语音为优先交互方式的智能体，大规模完成复杂任务。在涵盖多种约束条件下多步骤函数调用的基准测试 ComplexFuncBench Audio 上，与我们的上一代模型相比，它以 90.8% 的得分领先。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f73e1271b8fced49",
      "translationZh": "在 Scale AI 的 Audio MultiChallenge 上，Gemini 3.1 Flash Live 在开启“思考”功能的情况下以 36.1% 的得分领先。该基准测试专门考察模型在真实世界音频中常见的打断和犹豫情况下，遵循复杂指令和进行长程推理的能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "592f9ca5243c4017",
      "translationZh": "3.1 Flash Live 还提升了对语调的理解能力，从而提供更自然的对话。在 Gemini Enterprise for Customer Experience 中，它在识别音高和语速等细微声学特征方面，甚至比 2.5 Flash Native Audio 更有效。它也更善于根据用户表达出的沮丧或困惑，动态调整自己的回应。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f64ebe5d22b7005b",
      "translationZh": "3.1 Flash Live 让你能够构建支持语音交互的智能体，在嘈杂环境中处理复杂任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "febc527454fffa88",
      "translationZh": "使用 Gemini 3.1 Pro 构建的示意性演示，由 Gemini 3.1 Flash Live 驱动。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40bd7b4302f5d7e0",
      "translationZh": "3.1 Flash Live 让你能用语音进行氛围编程，并快速迭代。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "67f70237b1da2f26",
      "translationZh": "Verizon、LiveKit 和 The Home Depot 等公司对在其工作流程中使用 3.1 Flash Live 给出了积极反馈，特别提到了它经过改进、更加自然的对话体验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "502f9f5d95a4f25e",
      "translationZh": "面向所有人：更自然、更直观的交互",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d812541513c7fab9",
      "translationZh": "在 Gemini Live 和 Search Live 中，无论你是在询问日常小问题，还是在进行更复杂的对话，3.1 Flash Live 模型都能提供更有帮助、更自然的回应。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7350cbd849a66811",
      "translationZh": "在 3.1 Flash Live 模型的驱动下，Gemini Live 的响应速度比使用上一代模型时更快，而且它能持续跟上对话脉络的时间延长至原来的两倍，让你在较长的头脑风暴过程中保持思路连贯。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c14c3bea74c719ac",
      "translationZh": "3.1 Flash Live 让 Gemini Live 更快、更有帮助",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f4c5ba840c94257",
      "translationZh": "3.1 Flash Live 还原生支持多语言，这使得 Search Live 能在本周扩展至全球。随着此次发布，超过 200 个国家和地区的用户现在可以用自己偏好的语言，与 Search 进行实时、多模态对话。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f78b7e29803c112",
      "translationZh": "通过 Search Live 中的 3.1 Flash Live，获取实时故障排查帮助",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3ce0be026ffbc638",
      "translationZh": "试用 Gemini 3.1 Flash Live",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "107d43b32fd77242",
      "translationZh": "3.1 Flash Live 生成的所有音频都带有 SynthID 水印。这种无法感知的水印直接嵌入音频输出中，使 AI 生成的内容能够被可靠地检测出来，从而帮助防止错误信息传播。有关我们在安全和责任方面所采取方法的更多信息，请参阅模型卡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5456b1982b2fa336",
      "translationZh": "从今天起，体验 3.1 Flash Live 的自然性与可靠性。我们期待看到你如何与它互动，以及利用它进行构建。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ba07e0e30582b629",
      "translationZh": "在收件箱中获取 Google 的最新消息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1c2f6429af68386",
      "translationZh": "已完成。只差最后一步。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "177af4ad1775d8ae",
      "translationZh": "请查看收件箱以确认订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ff091e7a47df15e",
      "translationZh": "你也可以使用一个来订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fefef2f9c6cb957b",
      "translationZh": "我们在 2026 年 9 月公布的最新 AI 消息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "81c0514443d15d43",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 4 Argon：开启我们的前沿智能新纪元",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4f32c94e810121bc",
      "translationZh": "观看 Future Vision XPRIZE 获奖预告片《The Gifted》。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1dcfa6e64bf1becb",
      "translationZh": "看看 4 位开发者正在用 Gemini 3.8 Flash 打造什么",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "39afd3b78512f5a1",
      "translationZh": "推出搭载 Live Avatar 的 Gemini 3.8 Live",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c6c3ba8ca3a0a1e",
      "translationZh": "作者：Shuo-yiin Chang 和 CJ Zheng",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
